{"data":{"id":1,"documentId":"oqacq1bk6eh82nsykolc4pqo","createdAt":"2025-01-08T13:09:57.756Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-19T08:56:33.304Z","publishedAt":"2026-01-19T08:56:32.859Z","locale":"en","extended_header":{"id":68,"bg_color":"#27e2cc","fg_color":"teal-600","title":{"id":829,"heading":"Our History","minititle":"About us","text":"We are committed to making play better for all. Our portfolio includes thriving lotteries in\nregulated markets. Allwyn also recognises the important role it can play in player protection\nand sustainability in the digital era.","minititle_url":"/about-us","subheading":null},"logo":null,"image":{"id":1357,"documentId":"a062dm7px68gamtpakuatkx7","name":"about_hero_assets.png","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":1179,"height":996,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"ext":".png","url":"https://cdn.allwyn.com/thumbnail_about_hero_assets_e9cea8b80f.png","hash":"thumbnail_about_hero_assets_e9cea8b80f","mime":"image/png","name":"thumbnail_about_hero_assets.png","path":null,"size":23.44,"width":185,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":23436}},"hash":"about_hero_assets_e9cea8b80f","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","size":509.75,"url":"https://cdn.allwyn.com/about_hero_assets_e9cea8b80f.png","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-03-14T13:05:50.008Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-15T09:26:31.031Z","publishedAt":"2025-03-14T13:05:50.008Z","focalPoint":null},"accent":null},"metadata":{"id":235,"title":"Our History || Allwyn","description":null,"og_title":"Our History || Allwyn","og_description":null,"noindex":null,"og_image":null},"dynamic_zone":[{"id":1,"title":{"id":332,"text":null,"align":"left","text_size":null},"items":[{"id":265,"year":2026,"text":"- Allwyn acquired a majority stake in leading daily fantasy sports operator PrizePicks"},{"id":232,"year":2025,"text":"- Allwyn and OPAP announced the intention to pursue a business combination to create the second largest listed lottery and gaming operator globally (based on consolidated LTM Jun-25 EBITDA pro forma for announced acquisitions of PrizePicks and Novibet. Excludes land-based casino operators)\n- KKCG sold a 4.27% stake in Allwyn to Czech qualified investor fund J&T ARCH INVESTMENTS SICAV a.s.\n- The LottoItalia consortium, of which Allwyn is a part, was successful in being selected to operate the Italian Lotto licence for 9 more years\n- Allwyn acquired a minority stake in German lottery company Next Lotto, a licensed online reseller\n- Allwyn signed multi-year sponsorship deals with both Formula 1® and the McLaren Formula 1® Team"},{"id":199,"year":2024,"text":"- Allwyn International a.s. redomiciled to Switzerland (becoming Allwyn International AG)\n- Allwyn acquired a 70% stake in Instant Win Gaming, a leading supplier of digital instant win games to lotteries\n- Allwyn successfully commenced operation of the Fourth Licence of The National Lottery in the UK\n"},{"id":1,"year":2023,"text":"- Allwyn acquired Camelot Lottery Solutions Group, becoming the operator of the Illinois state lottery and acquiring iLottery technology and content\n- Allwyn acquired Camelot Lotteries UK Limited, becoming the operator of the 3rd UK National Lottery licence\n- Preferred shares held by funds advised by Apollo Global Management Inc. were repurchased in full\n- Allwyn increased its shareholding in OPAP to 50.18% (50.43% excluding treasury shares) as at 30 Jun 2023"},{"id":2,"year":2022,"text":"- Allwyn was awarded the 4th licence to operate the UK National Lottery, from February 2024\n- Allwyn increased its shareholding in OPAP to 49.84% (50.09% excluding treasury shares) as at 31 Dec 2022\n- Allwyn acquired a 36.75% interest in Betano\n"},{"id":34,"year":2021,"text":"- Allwyn became the new brand of SAZKA Group\n- Subsequently (in 2022), SAZKA Entertainment AG was renamed Allwyn AG, and SAZKA Group a.s. was renamed Allwyn International a.s.\n- SAZKA Group increased its shareholding in CASAG to 59.7%\n- SAZKA Entertainment AG, a 100% owned subsidiary of KKCG, became the sole ordinary shareholder of SAZKA Group\n- Funds advised by Apollo Global Management Inc. closed a €500 million strategic investment in SAZKA Entertainment AG\n- SAZKA Group increased its shareholding in OPAP to 40.37% (40.58% excluding treasury shares) as at 31 Dec 2021"},{"id":35,"year":2020,"text":"- SAZKA Group increased its shareholding in CASAG to 55.5%"},{"id":36,"year":2019,"text":"- KKCG became the sole owner of SAZKA Group, acquiring EMMA Capital's 25% interest. EMMA Capital retained the SuperSport business\n- SAZKA Group acquired an additional 7.25% shareholding in OPAP"},{"id":37,"year":2018,"text":"- SAZKA Group completed the acquisition of an additional shareholding in CASAG\n- SAZKA Group acquired a 67% shareholding in SuperSport, the largest provider of sports betting in Croatia based on its profit before taxation"},{"id":38,"year":2017,"text":"- SAZKA Group entered into binding agreements on the acquisition of further shares in CASAG to increase its indirect stake to 34%"},{"id":39,"year":2016,"text":"- KKCG and EMMA Capital merged their lottery and gaming assets into SAZKA Group\n- SAZKA Group acquired a 32.5% stake in LOTTOITALIA by establishing a joint venture with incumbent operator Lottomatica, which was awarded the Italian Lotto concession for 9 years\n- SAZKA Group acquired an 11.6% stake in Austrian Lotteries"},{"id":40,"year":2015,"text":"- KKCG and EMMA Capital jointly acquired an 11.3% shareholding in CASAG, Austria’s largest gaming and lottery company"},{"id":41,"year":2013,"text":"- EMMA Capital completed its acquisition of a controlling 33% shareholding in OPAP, Greece's largest lottery and gaming company, from the Greek state"},{"id":42,"year":2012,"text":"- KKCG became the sole owner of SAZKA a. s."},{"id":43,"year":2011,"text":"- KKCG became the co-owner of SAZKA a. s., the incumbent Czech lottery operator"}],"__component":"modules.timeline-module"},{"id":134,"bg_color":null,"title":{"id":333,"text":null,"align":"left","text_size":null},"items":[{"id":136,"heading":"All news","text":"Read the latest news from Allwyn and learn more about our business and the industry.","time_zone":null,"location":null},{"id":135,"heading":"Investor Relations","text":"Allwyn is a growing business operating in a global industry that has growth opportunities at every turn.","time_zone":null,"location":null}],"__component":"modules.features-module"}]},"meta":{}}